WEBVTT

00:00:01.920 --> 00:00:05.400
Someday, when I'm really in trouble...

00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:08.050
You can save me then.

00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:12.580
So let me do a bit more on my own today.

00:00:13.910 --> 00:00:15.190
I...

00:00:15.870 --> 00:00:17.370
I want to protect you, too!

00:00:20.290 --> 00:00:22.670
Hibiki!

00:00:24.470 --> 00:00:31.940
<i>Balwisyall nescell Gungnir tron.</i>

00:00:47.240 --> 00:00:48.810
Miku, I'm coming!

00:00:54.880 --> 00:00:58.030
Miku!

00:02:38.510 --> 00:02:43.010
<b>Episode 9 
The Origin of a Hero</b>

00:02:45.120 --> 00:02:45.940
Miku...

00:02:53.660 --> 00:02:55.610
Why did this happen?

00:03:07.900 --> 00:03:08.620
Tachibana!

00:03:09.950 --> 00:03:11.590
I'll leave them to you!

00:03:15.670 --> 00:03:18.160
<i>A Gatling gun has no need for greetings.</i>

00:03:18.160 --> 00:03:20.300
<i>Disparity's heading for the trash bin.</i>

00:03:20.490 --> 00:03:24.350
<i>One, two, three! Get out of my sight...</i>

00:03:25.180 --> 00:03:27.640
<i>If you want me to blow a hole in you,</i>

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:30.230
<i>get in line and say, "Adios."</i>

00:03:28.670 --> 00:03:30.940
<i>Things are going crazy, little by little.</i>

00:03:30.230 --> 00:03:33.670
<i>One, two, three! Get out of my face...</i>

00:03:30.940 --> 00:03:32.210
<i>Everything is falling apart.</i>

00:03:32.690 --> 00:03:35.120
<i>It's taking away my home!</i>

00:03:34.610 --> 00:03:37.380
<i>Feelings burned into hot metal,</i>

00:03:37.380 --> 00:03:39.830
<i>for the warm ties that bind me.</i>

00:03:39.830 --> 00:03:42.170
<i>This stuff ain't my style,</i>

00:03:40.810 --> 00:03:43.360
<i>Who's doing this?</i>

00:03:42.170 --> 00:03:44.620
<i>but I don't mind...</i>

00:03:44.620 --> 00:03:48.790
<i>Be a good kid, and go the hell to bed.</i>

00:03:45.450 --> 00:03:46.370
<i>Is it you?</i>

00:03:48.790 --> 00:03:53.690
<i>Ha ha! Go to hell! It's super confession time!</i>

00:03:52.700 --> 00:03:54.040
<i>Is it you?</i>

00:03:53.690 --> 00:03:58.000
<i>Go kneel and beg before Satan, in the pits of Hell.</i>

00:03:56.980 --> 00:03:58.000
<i>Noise...</i>

00:03:58.290 --> 00:04:03.680
<i>Ha ha! Go to hell! I won't regret anymore!</i>

00:03:58.500 --> 00:04:02.010
<i>If I hadn't activated the Staff of Solomon...</i>

00:04:02.820 --> 00:04:03.610
<i>Oh...</i>

00:04:03.680 --> 00:04:08.270
<i>I have a place to protect now,</i>

00:04:03.910 --> 00:04:06.510
<i>It's always my fault, isn't it?</i>

00:04:07.320 --> 00:04:08.270
<i>I...</i>

00:04:08.270 --> 00:04:12.620
<i>so I won't run anymore!</i>

00:04:39.910 --> 00:04:41.300
The US government?

00:04:41.590 --> 00:04:42.960
No doubt about it.

00:04:42.960 --> 00:04:46.440
Looks like they made contact with 
the FIS, and attempted a trade.

00:04:46.440 --> 00:04:48.800
And this disaster is the result?

00:04:49.280 --> 00:04:51.810
We can assume the negotiations were a failure.

00:04:52.190 --> 00:04:54.830
But no matter what either side had planned,

00:04:55.150 --> 00:04:57.940
it was in the best interest of both parties 
to avoid attracting attention.

00:04:58.290 --> 00:05:01.420
Some third party, who didn't want the FIS and

00:05:01.420 --> 00:05:04.790
the US government working together, intervened?

00:05:19.290 --> 00:05:22.200
<i>I shouldn't have let go.</i>

00:05:22.500 --> 00:05:25.020
<i>I shouldn't have let go of Miku's hand.</i>

00:05:26.850 --> 00:05:28.410
Have something warm to drink.

00:05:29.430 --> 00:05:30.980
It'll calm you down a little.

00:05:38.820 --> 00:05:39.980
Hibiki-chan?

00:05:40.990 --> 00:05:45.920
<i>But the warmest thing I had is gone...</i>

00:05:56.040 --> 00:05:57.960
My hands are stained with blood.

00:05:58.410 --> 00:06:00.990
Serena, I cannot...

00:06:07.450 --> 00:06:08.630
Tell me, Mom,

00:06:09.060 --> 00:06:10.320
what happened?

00:06:11.720 --> 00:06:14.140
I'll tell you.

00:06:14.730 --> 00:06:18.730
Nastassja met with the US government, 
to try to sell out

00:06:19.030 --> 00:06:23.570
our ideal of saving as many lives as 
possible from the lunar impact

00:06:23.940 --> 00:06:26.780
that will happen in the next ten years.

00:06:28.600 --> 00:06:29.400
Mom...

00:06:29.400 --> 00:06:30.820
Is that true?

00:06:31.430 --> 00:06:33.120
And that isn't all.

00:06:33.410 --> 00:06:34.670
It's a complete lie

00:06:34.670 --> 00:06:38.120
that Finé's soul dwells within Maria.

00:06:38.770 --> 00:06:41.880
It was all an act Nastassja and Maria dreamed up.

00:06:45.410 --> 00:06:46.320
I'm sorry.

00:06:46.980 --> 00:06:49.210
I'm sorry, both of you.

00:06:50.250 --> 00:06:53.160
If Maria isn't Finé, then...

00:06:53.160 --> 00:06:56.180
Even if the goal was to involve me in her plan,

00:06:57.450 --> 00:07:00.690
don't you think it was a betrayal

00:07:00.690 --> 00:07:02.940
that she involved you, too?

00:07:03.290 --> 00:07:06.500
The Nephilim heart, which I worked

00:07:06.500 --> 00:07:08.740
so hard to get, was almost useless.

00:07:18.530 --> 00:07:19.290
This is...

00:07:19.850 --> 00:07:21.540
Contact the commander immediately.

00:07:21.540 --> 00:07:22.210
Yes, sir.

00:07:22.210 --> 00:07:24.210
<b>Illsveil</b>

00:07:27.830 --> 00:07:30.220
Order something. I'll pay.

00:07:31.270 --> 00:07:33.580
I don't eat dinner past nine at night.

00:07:33.580 --> 00:07:35.800
That's what your problem is, you know?

00:07:35.800 --> 00:07:38.390
What are you trying to say? If there 
isn't a reason I'm here, I'm leaving!

00:07:39.360 --> 00:07:40.890
Are you mad?

00:07:41.260 --> 00:07:43.070
How could I be happy?

00:07:43.370 --> 00:07:46.960
FIS, Tachibana, and...

00:07:48.100 --> 00:07:51.000
When I think of my failure 
to protect my comrades...

00:07:53.950 --> 00:07:57.910
I called you because I wanted us 
to eat dinner together once.

00:07:58.560 --> 00:08:01.910
I thought it wouldn't be a bad idea 
to have a heart-to-heart talk.

00:08:02.420 --> 00:08:04.540
When did this happen to us?

00:08:04.880 --> 00:08:06.830
We're meant to have the same goal,

00:08:06.830 --> 00:08:08.730
but our hearts are in totally different places.

00:08:09.010 --> 00:08:10.290
We should work togeth—

00:08:10.290 --> 00:08:11.300
Yukine.

00:08:11.600 --> 00:08:13.310
If you really want to have a heart-to-heart,

00:08:13.630 --> 00:08:15.970
why don't you use my name?

00:08:17.600 --> 00:08:20.230
Th-That's because...

00:08:20.840 --> 00:08:22.090
H-Hey!

00:08:23.950 --> 00:08:25.610
Thank you very much!

00:08:27.310 --> 00:08:29.550
So I didn't get to talk to her.

00:08:30.410 --> 00:08:32.490
But maybe that's for the best.

00:08:36.110 --> 00:08:38.030
It's so bitter...

00:08:39.200 --> 00:08:41.290
Mom... Maria...

00:08:41.290 --> 00:08:44.070
The doctor's lying, right?

00:08:46.780 --> 00:08:47.630
It's true.

00:08:48.220 --> 00:08:50.130
Both that I'm not Finé

00:08:50.550 --> 00:08:55.030
and the fact that we tried to temporarily 
postpone our plan for saving humanity.

00:08:55.660 --> 00:08:56.830
No way.

00:08:57.980 --> 00:09:01.550
Mom tried to enlist the US government's help

00:09:01.550 --> 00:09:04.060
by offering information on Frontier.

00:09:05.060 --> 00:09:08.920
But you said the US government 
and the people running it

00:09:08.920 --> 00:09:11.630
are trying to ensure they're the 
only ones who'll survive...

00:09:11.930 --> 00:09:15.830
And I thought we were fighting the 
world, to save as many as possible

00:09:15.830 --> 00:09:18.140
of those they were abandoning!

00:09:18.900 --> 00:09:21.960
If we'd made peace,

00:09:21.960 --> 00:09:25.250
we would have lost our advantage.

00:09:25.550 --> 00:09:29.430
That's why you summoned Noise

00:09:29.430 --> 00:09:32.090
to ruin the meeting.

00:09:32.340 --> 00:09:33.910
Oh, no...

00:09:33.910 --> 00:09:36.090
I only protected you

00:09:36.350 --> 00:09:38.930
from those evil Americans!

00:09:40.700 --> 00:09:42.720
With the Staff of Solomon.

00:09:48.350 --> 00:09:49.280
Maria...

00:09:49.580 --> 00:09:50.970
Why?

00:09:52.520 --> 00:09:53.980
That's what I want to see.

00:09:54.380 --> 00:09:57.040
You cannot protect the world with false feelings.

00:09:57.430 --> 00:10:00.240
You cannot carry on what Serena wished to do.

00:10:01.470 --> 00:10:02.990
Everything comes down to power.

00:10:03.510 --> 00:10:07.750
Without power, you cannot enact justice!

00:10:08.140 --> 00:10:11.340
The doctor's way of doing things is 
the only way to change the world.

00:10:11.340 --> 00:10:13.750
So I am going to support the doctor!

00:10:20.990 --> 00:10:22.760
I don't want that.

00:10:23.280 --> 00:10:25.930
That means suppressing

00:10:25.930 --> 00:10:28.030
the ones without power.

00:10:33.570 --> 00:10:35.030
I understand.

00:10:35.520 --> 00:10:38.160
That is not the false Finé's choice,

00:10:38.160 --> 00:10:41.460
but Maria Cadenzavna Eve's choice, correct?

00:10:48.390 --> 00:10:49.750
Are you all right?

00:10:51.460 --> 00:10:53.500
Leave the rest to me.

00:10:53.730 --> 00:10:56.720
You rest, Nastassja.

00:10:56.720 --> 00:11:00.720
Now, then... I'll be busy adjusting our plans.

00:11:01.320 --> 00:11:04.010
I have to deal with our guest, as well.

00:11:15.080 --> 00:11:16.080
Hibiki...

00:11:24.710 --> 00:11:25.830
What's this?

00:11:26.110 --> 00:11:29.160
Miku-kun's communicator, found a short distance

00:11:29.160 --> 00:11:30.770
from Sky Tower.

00:11:31.410 --> 00:11:33.330
We pulled the records of its signal,

00:11:33.850 --> 00:11:35.590
and found it was moving

00:11:36.070 --> 00:11:39.160
for several minutes, at an almost constant speed.

00:11:40.390 --> 00:11:42.000
Miku-kun isn't dead.

00:11:42.450 --> 00:11:44.250
The obvious conclusion

00:11:44.250 --> 00:11:47.010
is that someone kidnapped her, but...

00:11:47.010 --> 00:11:48.970
Master, does that mean...

00:11:49.890 --> 00:11:52.980
It means you can't sit here looking glum!

00:11:53.620 --> 00:11:56.480
Now, then! Let's exercise, for a change of pace!

00:11:56.480 --> 00:11:57.540
Right!

00:12:14.210 --> 00:12:20.340
<i>Be myself, be strong... On to the journey.</i>

00:12:20.340 --> 00:12:26.350
<i>Blood and tears, heart and soul... 
Search for the meaning.</i>

00:12:20.640 --> 00:12:22.980
Why is he singing, anyway?

00:12:22.980 --> 00:12:25.240
And what the heck is this song?

00:12:25.240 --> 00:12:26.350
Is this okay?

00:12:26.590 --> 00:12:32.950
<i>I will bet everything I have, 
to write my own heroic fiction.</i>

00:12:27.510 --> 00:12:29.680
I guess she's just used to it.

00:12:30.860 --> 00:12:33.550
<i>That's right... I can't be depressed.</i>

00:12:32.950 --> 00:12:39.440
<i>Suffering will test me to the limit, 
for I am an awakened lion!</i>

00:12:34.100 --> 00:12:35.870
<i>I'm going to save Miku!</i>

00:12:39.440 --> 00:12:45.650
<i>March forth, you have all of the answers!</i>

00:12:45.650 --> 00:12:54.600
<i>Soar to the sky, for you have nothing to fear!</i>

00:13:10.230 --> 00:13:12.870
<i>They're all so bright and chipper...</i>

00:13:13.230 --> 00:13:15.610
<i>This place is too warm</i>

00:13:15.980 --> 00:13:18.030
<i>for someone like me.</i>

00:13:21.710 --> 00:13:29.380
<i>The apple floated in the sky.</i>

00:13:30.860 --> 00:13:38.610
<i>The apple fell down to the ground.</i>

00:13:39.250 --> 00:13:43.620
<i>The stars were born.</i>

00:13:43.620 --> 00:13:44.510
<i>The so—</i>

00:13:45.520 --> 00:13:46.510
What is it?

00:13:47.450 --> 00:13:48.320
Nothing.

00:13:49.740 --> 00:13:51.560
Thank you.

00:14:03.650 --> 00:14:05.320
If you don't want to die, come!

00:14:12.040 --> 00:14:15.230
Why did you save me?

00:14:15.580 --> 00:14:16.680
I don't know...

00:14:16.680 --> 00:14:19.920
Maybe the flames reminded me of Serena.

00:14:20.420 --> 00:14:21.380
Serena?

00:14:21.680 --> 00:14:23.670
Maria's late little sister.

00:14:24.440 --> 00:14:25.530
Doctor?

00:14:28.350 --> 00:14:30.690
I'm the one who saved her,

00:14:30.690 --> 00:14:33.570
but you are the one who ordered 
me to bring her here.

00:14:33.570 --> 00:14:34.850
Why?

00:14:35.280 --> 00:14:39.150
Naturally, as part of our plan.

00:14:40.290 --> 00:14:42.590
Don't look so scared.

00:14:42.590 --> 00:14:44.980
Why don't we talk for a bit?

00:14:45.340 --> 00:14:48.290
I'm sure I can help you.

00:14:51.160 --> 00:14:53.200
<i>If Maria isn't Finé...</i>

00:14:53.650 --> 00:14:55.360
<i>Then she must be inside me.</i>

00:14:55.870 --> 00:14:57.370
<i>I'm scared.</i>

00:14:57.890 --> 00:15:00.560
What happened to Maria?

00:15:01.860 --> 00:15:05.480
I wanted to help because of Maria.

00:15:06.450 --> 00:15:08.230
Not because of Finé.

00:15:08.230 --> 00:15:10.590
Y-Yeah, that's right.

00:15:10.840 --> 00:15:14.130
When we cried all the time 
because we had no family,

00:15:14.130 --> 00:15:16.130
Maria was nice to us.

00:15:16.480 --> 00:15:19.070
She was a friend to the weak.

00:15:19.420 --> 00:15:20.400
But...

00:15:21.500 --> 00:15:23.830
Without power,

00:15:23.830 --> 00:15:26.400
you cannot enact justice!

00:15:29.140 --> 00:15:31.420
Aren't you scared, Shirabe?

00:15:32.360 --> 00:15:34.430
If Maria isn't Finé,

00:15:34.430 --> 00:15:37.090
that means that one of us

00:15:37.090 --> 00:15:40.320
might have Finé in our souls.

00:15:41.790 --> 00:15:44.400
I don't really know...

00:15:44.400 --> 00:15:45.790
That's it?

00:15:47.340 --> 00:15:48.210
What's wrong?

00:15:50.590 --> 00:15:51.470
Kiri-chan?

00:15:59.230 --> 00:16:00.340
<i>Just a little more.</i>

00:16:00.640 --> 00:16:02.980
<i>Just wait a little more, Miku!</i>

00:16:10.860 --> 00:16:12.990
How's Mom?

00:16:13.410 --> 00:16:15.740
She needs to lie down for a while.

00:16:15.740 --> 00:16:17.010
In addition to exhaustion,

00:16:17.010 --> 00:16:18.700
her symptoms are progressing.

00:16:19.050 --> 00:16:20.250
No...

00:16:20.250 --> 00:16:23.830
In other words, there's no time!

00:16:24.190 --> 00:16:26.010
Before the Moon falls,

00:16:26.010 --> 00:16:30.240
humanity must come together, in a new land.

00:16:30.240 --> 00:16:34.470
And leading them there will be our task!

00:16:36.140 --> 00:16:37.080
What's this?

00:16:37.970 --> 00:16:40.290
A US patrol ship?!

00:16:40.290 --> 00:16:42.600
This was anticipated.

00:16:42.940 --> 00:16:46.590
Why not make some big, flashy 
explosions to destroy it,

00:16:46.590 --> 00:16:48.860
and focus the world's attention on us?

00:16:49.160 --> 00:16:52.370
That's how the strong do things, 
and it creates the weak—

00:16:52.370 --> 00:16:54.790
It may be the perfect demonstration

00:16:54.790 --> 00:16:57.510
to deliver our message to the world.

00:16:58.840 --> 00:16:59.830
Maria—

00:16:59.140 --> 00:16:59.830
I...

00:17:00.620 --> 00:17:01.970
We are Finé.

00:17:02.680 --> 00:17:06.380
We shall bring an end to the world in 
which the strong control the weak.

00:17:06.720 --> 00:17:09.130
I shan't fear to tread this path.

00:17:14.410 --> 00:17:15.800
Noise pattern detected!

00:17:15.800 --> 00:17:18.350
US patrol ship is broadcasting an SOS!

00:17:21.070 --> 00:17:22.820
They aren't far from this area.

00:17:22.820 --> 00:17:23.730
We'll head there immediately!

00:17:24.120 --> 00:17:25.770
I'll get ready.

00:17:25.770 --> 00:17:27.730
Tsubasa-san! I'll go, too—

00:17:28.340 --> 00:17:30.150
Are you trying to get yourself killed?

00:17:31.220 --> 00:17:33.260
Stay here, okay?

00:17:33.580 --> 00:17:36.820
You can't leave us.

00:17:40.230 --> 00:17:41.440
Please.

00:17:58.470 --> 00:18:01.310
Is this what you want, Maria?

00:18:01.670 --> 00:18:05.060
To protect the weak, is this 
truly what you have to do?

00:18:09.280 --> 00:18:10.060
Shirabe!

00:18:12.070 --> 00:18:13.690
What are you doing?

00:18:13.690 --> 00:18:15.940
If Maria is suffering,

00:18:16.460 --> 00:18:18.110
I'm going to help her.

00:18:18.600 --> 00:18:19.820
Shirabe!

00:18:19.820 --> 00:18:28.040
<i>Fallian Shul Shagana tron.</i>

00:18:57.230 --> 00:18:58.270
Shirabe!

00:18:59.110 --> 00:19:02.870
If you want to bring her back, 
I have the perfect way.

00:19:02.870 --> 00:19:09.020
<i>I tilted my head and saw the love 
slipping through my fingers.</i>

00:19:09.020 --> 00:19:14.880
<i>If I picked it up and piled it up, 
would it reach to the Moon?</i>

00:19:12.880 --> 00:19:14.550
<b>Type Alpha 100 Samsara</b>

00:19:15.150 --> 00:19:21.240
<i>Realism mixed with errors, educating my DNA.</i>

00:19:21.240 --> 00:19:27.140
<i>A monochrome prison in which 
I just bow my head like a doll.</i>

00:19:27.140 --> 00:19:33.620
<i>That's why I'm going to slice this world to pieces.</i>

00:19:34.780 --> 00:19:43.660
<i>To protect someone, I must believe 
that true strength is courage,</i>

00:19:43.660 --> 00:19:47.160
<i>and dream of those tales.</i>

00:19:47.160 --> 00:19:50.880
<i>I've almost forgotten that smile.</i>

00:19:50.880 --> 00:19:54.040
<i>But it's okay, I can still fly.</i>

00:19:58.550 --> 00:20:00.820
Kiri-chan, thank—

00:20:02.110 --> 00:20:04.010
Wh-What did...

00:20:04.800 --> 00:20:05.760
LiNKER?

00:20:06.000 --> 00:20:08.580
No, this is an anti-LiNKER.

00:20:08.880 --> 00:20:11.890
It's used to lower compatibility values.

00:20:11.890 --> 00:20:14.460
I can guarantee its effectiveness.

00:20:17.020 --> 00:20:19.290
My Gear isn't holding...

00:20:23.380 --> 00:20:27.270
I... I may stop being myself!

00:20:27.570 --> 00:20:28.960
Before that happens,

00:20:28.960 --> 00:20:30.500
I need to leave something behind.

00:20:30.500 --> 00:20:32.840
Or you'll forget me.

00:20:33.640 --> 00:20:34.720
Kiri-chan?

00:20:35.350 --> 00:20:37.730
Even if I disappear,

00:20:37.730 --> 00:20:39.300
if the world is still here,

00:20:39.300 --> 00:20:42.050
the memories we shared will still be here!

00:20:42.660 --> 00:20:46.650
That's why I'm going to protect the 
world the way the doctor wants.

00:20:47.730 --> 00:20:50.220
I don't have a choice anymore...

00:20:58.320 --> 00:20:59.780
Don't get in my way!

00:21:00.800 --> 00:21:01.860
Kiri-chan!

00:21:01.860 --> 00:21:04.200
Hey, is Ver not here?

00:21:05.510 --> 00:21:08.700
Where's the guy using the Staff of Solomon?!

00:21:15.000 --> 00:21:15.830
Tsubasa-san!

00:21:15.830 --> 00:21:16.840
Kirika!

00:21:17.290 --> 00:21:21.210
Then let's tilt the scales back the other way...

00:21:21.550 --> 00:21:23.970
In the most dramatic way possible.

00:21:24.200 --> 00:21:26.710
In the most romantic way possible!

00:21:27.260 --> 00:21:28.970
You aren't going to...

00:21:30.700 --> 00:21:38.980
<i>Rei Shenshoujin rei zizzl.</i>

00:22:02.370 --> 00:22:03.510
Miku?
